§ T19 cssllint + JSON
  new : parser/main.odin cssllint_main subcommand
  usage : parser cssllint [--json] [--strict] [--strict-parse] <file>
  JSON schema :
    { file, status, counts:{info,warn,error}, diags:[{line,col,sev,code,msg}] }
  codes : CSL-{E,W,I}-NNN (lex/parse/morph/slot/evidence/compound/permissive)
  exit : status=error → 1 ; strict+warn → 1 ; else 0
  spec : specs/14_CSSLv3_BRIDGE.csl §§ LINT-PROTOCOL-Session-4-T19
